.TH PSAddConvolutionalLayer 3 2025-01-20 "PsyC 0.9.5" "PsyC Library Functions Manual"

.SH NAME
\fBPSAddConvolutionalLayer\fR \- Add a convolutional layer to model

.SH LIBRARY
PsyC (-lpsyc)

.SH SYNOPSIS

.B
#include <psyc/psyc.h>

.I
PSLayer  *
.br
\fBPSAddConvolutionalLayer\fR(\fIPSModel *model\fR, \fIPSLayerDef *ldef\fR)
.SH DESCRIPTION
Add a convolutional layer to \fImodel\fR. This function basically calls \fIPSAddLayer\fR:
.br


PSAddLayer(model, Convolutional, 0, ldef);
.br




.SH RETURN VALUES
See \fIPSAddLayer\fR.

.SH SEE ALSO
psyc(1), PSAddLayer(3)
